## Waiting for completion

With `wait_for_completion = true` the action polls the job until it completes. Every request uses a current access token, and network errors, throttling (HTTP 429) and server errors (HTTP 5xx) are retried by the Azure SDK within the time left on `timeout_minutes`. When it runs out, including while a status check is still being retried, the action fails but the job is not stopped and may still be running; the error then also gives the last status check error.

